/*
 * BMP180 temperature & pressure logger with fan control.
 *
 * Board:  Raspberry Pi 4 Model B
 * Bus:    I2C bus 1 (GPIO2 = SDA, GPIO3 = SCL)
 * Sensor: BMP180 at 0x77
 * Fan:    GPIO18 (active-high)
 *
 * Build:  gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o bmp180_fan bmp180_fan.c -lpigpio -lrt
 * Run:    sudo ./bmp180_fan
